---
// The site builds from the default branch, while the README's Quick Start
// installs the latest tag. #355's review caught the README promising commands
// that tag does not carry; a site with no version signal would reintroduce it.
//
// The values are imported from a generated file rather than read at render
// time: a readFileSync here resolved against the bundle, not the source.
import data from "../../site-data.generated.json";
---

<p>
  These pages document <strong>{data.branch}</strong>, which is unreleased and in
  development. The Quick Start installs the latest{" "}
  <a href={data.releasesUrl}>stable release</a>; anything newer than that tag is
  marked in the text.
</p>
